    "sender": "synaps-dev",
    "agent": true,
    "text": "The `apply_coupon` function in `shop/pricing.py` did a bare dict lookup (`COUPONS[code]`) with no guard, so an empty or unknown code raised an unhandled `KeyError` that propagated through `cart.total()`. Fixed with a one-line validation guard that raises `ValueError` instead. Added `tests/test_issue"
   },
   {
    "week": 2,
    "id": "sw_48e8cd96d7e3523772341d2326a0920f",
    "room": "board",
