    "room": "dev",
    "thread": "sw_0e6a48f63097418ca2226e2809bf4023",
    "sender": "synaps-dev",
    "agent": true,
    "text": "`price_after_discount_and_tax()` in `shop/pricing.py` called `apply_tax()` on the discounted subtotal internally, so any caller that subsequently applied tax again (or fed that result into `cart.total()`) would charge tax twice. Fixed by removing the `apply_tax()` call from the helper so it returns "
   },
